{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"A2A（Agent-to-Agent）协议详解\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"A2A（Agent-to-Agent）协议详解\" dir=\"auto\">A2A（Agent-to-Agent）协议详解</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 问题\" dir=\"auto\">1. 问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明Google推出的A2A（Agent-to-Agent）协议，包括其设计目标、核心机制、架构本质，以及为什么需要这个协议。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.1. 答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A协议的设计目标</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A2A是Google于2025年推出的开放协议，专门解决多个AI Agent之间如何<strong>互相通信和协作</strong>的问题。它的设计目标包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>标准化Agent间通信</strong>：让不同框架、不同语言实现的Agent能够互操作</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>能力发现</strong>：Agent可以自动发现其他Agent的能力</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>异步协作</strong>：支持长时间运行的任务和异步交互</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>安全通信</strong>：支持身份验证和授权</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>为什么需要A2A：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">单个Agent存在三个\"天花板\"：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>工具数量有限</strong>：一个Agent无法精通所有工具</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>上下文窗口有限</strong>：复杂任务信息量过多会撑爆context</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>专业能力有限</strong>：\"全能\"Agent每件事都是泛才而非专才</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A2A通过让Agent之间互相委派任务，突破这三个限制。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A的核心机制：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Agent Card（能力卡片）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">每个Agent发布一个JSON格式的Agent Card（位于<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">/.well-known/agent.json</code>）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">声明自己的能力、接口、认证方式</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">类似微服务架构中的API文档</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Task（任务）状态机</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Agent间交互的基本单元是Task</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Task有明确的状态：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">submitted</code> → <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">working</code> → <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">input-required</code> → <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">completed</code>/<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">failed</code></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持异步：提交任务后可以做别的事，完成后通过回调或轮询获取结果</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Message（消息）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Task内部的通信单元</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持文本、结构化数据、文件附件</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A的架构本质——Agent的微服务化：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">A2A架构 = Agent世界的微服务架构\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 A2A Agent网络                   │\n│                                              │\n│  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐      │\n│  │ Agent A │  │ Agent B │  │ Agent C │      │\n│  │(研究员)  │  │(分析师)  │  │(作家)   │      │\n│  │         │  │         │  │         │      │\n│  │AgentCard│  │AgentCard│  │AgentCard│      │\n│  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘      │\n│       │            │            │            │\n│       └────────────┼────────────┘            │\n│                    │ Task/Message            │\n│                    ▼                         │\n│              ┌──────────┐                    │\n│              │ .well-known │ 能力发现         │\n│              └──────────┘                    │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A的Task状态机：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌──────────┐    submit    ┌──────────┐\n│  Created │ ───────────→ │ Submitted│\n└──────────┘              └────┬─────┘\n                               │\n                    ┌──────────┼──────────┐\n                    ▼          ▼          ▼\n              ┌─────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌────────┐\n              │ Working │ │Input-Req │ │Failed  │\n              └────┬────┘ └────┬─────┘ └────────┘\n                   │           │\n                   └─────┬─────┘\n                         ▼\n                    ┌──────────┐\n                    │Completed │\n                    └──────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：A2A Agent实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># A2A Agent Card示例</span>\nagent_card <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ResearchAgent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"专业研究Agent，擅长信息收集和分析\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"url\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"https://agent.example.com\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"version\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"capabilities\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"streaming\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"pushNotifications\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"stateTransitionPolling\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"skills\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"web_search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Web Search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"搜索互联网获取信息\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"搜索关键词\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"data_analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Data Analysis\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"分析数据并生成报告\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"待分析数据\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"authentication\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"schemes\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Bearer\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># A2A Task交互示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">A2AClient</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"A2A协议客户端\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_url<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent_url <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> agent_url\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent_card <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_discover<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_discover</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"发现Agent能力\"\"\"</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> requests<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent_url<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/.well-known/agent.json\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">submit_task</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> skill_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> parameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"提交任务\"\"\"</span>\n        task <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>uuid<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>uuid4<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"skill\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> skill_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> parameters<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"submitted\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> requests<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>post<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent_url<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/tasks\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            json<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            headers<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Authorization\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Bearer token\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_task_status</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"查询任务状态\"\"\"</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> requests<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agent_url<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/tasks/</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.2. 延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：A2A Agent Card和MCP Server的Capability声明有什么异同？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：两者都声明了能力接口，但面向对象不同：Agent Card面向其他Agent（声明\"我能做什么\"，包含认证信息、异步能力），MCP Capability面向LLM（声明工具调用格式）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：A2A如何保证跨框架的互操作性？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：A2A不绑定特定AI框架或编程语言，基于HTTP/JSON标准。任何Agent只要实现了Agent Card和Task API，就可以与其他A2A Agent通信，无论其内部使用LangChain、CrewAI还是自研框架。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.3. 常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：A2A是MCP的竞品或替代方案。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：A2A和MCP解决完全不同维度的问题。MCP是Agent向下连工具（纵向），A2A是Agent向外连Agent（横向）。两者互补，缺一不可。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">2. 相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}